    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Strive for the Heights of Heroism</p></blockquote><p>Paladins who swear the Oath of Glory believe that they and their companions are destined to achieve glory through heroic deeds. They train diligently and encourage their companions so that all are ready when destiny calls.</p><p>These Paladins share the following tenets:</p><ul><li>Endeavor to be known by your deeds.</li><li>Face hardships with courage.</li><li>Inspire others to strive for glory.</li></ul><h3>Oath of Glory Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.FkvXPqYdZAlUvanb]{Inspiring Smite}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.EDsQlFpE3V5GqZI8]{Oath of Glory Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.VrM0zE0iBQSdzVS7]{Peerless Athlete}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.GmwCIEOBtWCMDfk3]{Aura of Alacrity}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ukySTrDSujb7RBom]{Glorious Defense}</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.NTGrIGdBuL9iqYnR]{Living Legend}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Oath of Glory Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Paladin Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGuidingBol]{Guiding Bolt}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHeroism000]{Heroism}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplEnhanceAbi]{Enhance Ability}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMagicWeapo]{Magic Weapon}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHaste00000]{Haste}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbProtectionFro]{Protection from Energy}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCompulsion]{Compulsion}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFreedomofM]{Freedom of Movement}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLegendLore]{Legend Lore}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.jigSAmkORv7MD9fK]{Yolande's Regal Presence}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
